CORE
main.go
--go-race-check --unwind 3 --unwinding-assertions
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
^\[go::main\.main\.data-race\.\d+\] line 15 data race \(write\): FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
Every byte of an access is flagged, and the check of the access that
starts later (byte 3) sees the flags of the other.
